    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d257-a1">

                <pb facs="0366" n="246" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg246"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Snyder to the Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-06-29"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 29,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that the following telegram was received by me last night, June
                    28:</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Segovia</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">June 13</hi>,</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Remedios</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">June 14, 1905.</hi></p>
                <p>Mr. Joseff Otto, American citizen, was murdered on the 11th of this month. He was
                    married less than a month and left properties and pending business. I advise you
                    for legal effects. Please acknowledge receipt.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Vespasiano Zea J.</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Alcalde.</hi></p>
                <p>The Federal government is hereby respectfully requested to make a full
                    investigation of this homicide and to use its influence and authority to effect
                    the immediate apprehension of the guilty person or persons and an early and just
                    trial, and, further, that this legation be fully informed of all the
                    circumstances of the occurrence and the steps taken by the authorities.</p>
                <p>I take, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alban G. Snyder.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
